Task 1: Remove obsolete Docker packages.  
Description Task 1: Ensure that any old versions of Docker packages specified in the `docker_obsolete_packages` variable are not installed on the system.

Task 2: Add Docker GPG key.  
Description Task 2: Import the Docker GPG key specified in the `docker_yum_gpg_key` variable to verify package integrity, but only if `docker_add_repo` is true.

Task 3: Add Docker repository.  
Description Task 3: Add the Docker repository using the URL specified in `docker_yum_repo_url` and save it to a file named `docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo` in the `/etc/yum.repos.d` directory, but only if `docker_add_repo` is true.

Task 4: Configure Docker Nightly repo.  
Description Task 4: Enable or disable the Docker Nightly repository section in the `docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo` file based on the `docker_yum_repo_enable_nightly` variable value, without extra spaces, but only if `docker_add_repo` is true.

Task 5: Configure Docker Test repo.  
Description Task 5: Enable or disable the Docker Test repository section in the `docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo` file based on the `docker_yum_repo_enable_test` variable value, without extra spaces, but only if `docker_add_repo` is true.

Task 6: Configure containerd on RHEL 8.  
Description Task 6: On RHEL 8, ensure that the `runc` package is not installed, `container-selinux` is installed, and `containerd.io` is installed.


- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- name: Configure Docker
  tasks:
  - name: Remove obsolete Docker packages
    package_remove:
      name: "{{ docker_obsolete_packages }}"

  - name: Add Docker GPG key
    apt_key:
      keyserver: '{{ docker_yum_gpg_key }}'
      state: present
    when: docker_add_repo == true

  - name: Add Docker repository
    yum_repository:
      name: "{{ docker_edition }}"
      description: "{{ docker_edition }} repo"
      baseurl: "{{ docker_yum_repo_url }}"
      file: "/etc/yum.repos.d/docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo"
      enabled: yes
      gpgcheck: yes
      gpgkey: "{{ docker_yum_gpg_key }}"
    when: docker_add_repo == true

  - name: Configure Docker Nightly repo
    lineinfile:
      dest: "/etc/yum.repos.d/docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo"
      line: "enabled={{ docker_yum_repo_enable_nightly }}"
      state: present
      regexp: "^enabled"
    when: docker_add_repo == true

  - name: Configure Docker Test repo
    lineinfile:
      dest: "/etc/yum.repos.d/docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo"
      line: "enabled={{ docker_yum_repo_enable_test }}"
      state: present
      regexp: "^enabled"
    when: docker_add_repo == true

  - name: Configure containerd on RHEL 8
    when: ansible_distribution == "RedHat" and ansible_distribution_major_version == "8"
    block:
      - name: Uninstall runc
        package:
          name: runc
          state: absent
      - name: Install container-selinux
        package:
          name: container-selinux
          state: present
      - name: Install containerd.io
        package:
          name: containerd.io
          state: present


