content='Here is the complete YAML playbook as requested:\n\n```yml\n---\n- name: Collect OS release information from the bootstrap server\n  hosts: bootstrap\n  become: {{ bootstrap_become }}\n  become_user: {{ bootstrap_become_user }}\n  gather_facts: no\n\n  tasks:\n  - name: Collect OS release information\n    command:\n      cmd: cat /etc/os-release\n      chdir: /root\n    register: bootstrap_facts\n    args:\n      executable: /bin/bash\n\n  - name: Set bootstrap facts for distribution and major version\n    set_fact:\n      bootstrap_distribution: \'\'\n      bootstrap_distribution_major_version: \'\'\n    when:\n      - rc == 0\n      - bootstrap_distribution is undefined\n      - (bootstrap_facts.stdout | regex_search(\'PRETTY_NAME=(.*)\') and\n        bootstrap_distribution_major_version not in bootstrap_facts.stdout and\n        (bootstrap_distribution_major_version |\n         regex_search(\'.*{{ bootstrap_distribution }}.*\')) is not matched)\n    delegate_to: localhost\n    delegate_facts: yes\n\n    set_fact:\n      bootstrap_distribution: "{{ bootstrap_facts.stdout | regex_search(\'PRETTY_NAME=(.*)\') | regex_replace(\'PRETTY_NAME=\',\'\') }}"\n      bootstrap_distribution_major_version: "{{ bootstrap_distribution | regex_replace(\'(\\\\d{1,2})\\\\..*\', \'\\\\1\') }}"\n\n  - name: Set bootstrap facts for the OS family\n    set_fact:\n      bootstrap_os_family: \'\'\n    when:\n      - rc == 0\n      - bootstrap_distribution is defined\n      - (bootstrap_distribution | regex_search(\'(.*)\\\\s.*\\\\s.*\\\\s(\\\\d{1,2})\\\\..*\') and\n        bootstrap_os_family not in bootstrap_facts.stdout and\n        (bootstrap_os_family |\n         regex_search(\'.*{{ bootstrap_distribution }}.*\')) is not matched)\n    delegate_to: localhost\n    delegate_facts: yes\n\n    set_fact:\n      bootstrap_os_family: "{{ lookup(\'dict\', bootstrap__os_family_map)[bootstrap_distribution] }}"\n```\n\nThis generated playbook meets the given instructions and specificatio